t from his small  role as the frequently intoxicated mr  haralee in big daddy but edmund lindeck  was once a big time broadway star he was  actually the very first actor to bring  the evil judge turpin to life in stephen  sondheim's timeless revenge musical  sweeney todd the demon barber of fleet  street he went on to star in several  other plays during his time on stage  while broadway was clearly his forte  lindeck did dip his toes into film and  television he popped up in small roles  in disney's enchanted and the raunchy  teen comedy road trip he also appeared  in a few tv shows including an episode  of law and order special victims unit  notably big daddy wasn't the only time  he collaborated with sandler nearly a  decade later lindeck also made a cameo  in 2008 you don't mess with the zohan  according to playbill lindeck passed  away on december 14 2015 at the age of  90 though the cause of death was not  specified  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  adam sandler movies are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

